graph TD
    %% Transcription Elongation Context
    A[Active Transcription Elongation] --> B[RNAP Approaching Gene End]
    B --> C[/Termination Signal<br/>Type?/]
    
    %% Intrinsic Termination Pathway
    C -->|Intrinsic| D[Hairpin Formation in RNA]
    D --> E[U-Rich Sequence]
    E --> F[RNA-DNA Hybrid Destabilization]
    F --> G[Transcript Release]
    G --> H[Core RNAP Release]
    
    %% Rho-Dependent Termination Pathway
    C -->|Rho-Dependent| I[Rho Binding to rut Site]
    I --> J[Rho Hexamer Assembly]
    J --> K[ATP-Dependent Translocation]
    K --> L[Rho Catches RNAP]
    L --> M[RNA-DNA Unwinding]
    M --> N[Transcript Release]
    N --> O[Core RNAP Release]
    
    %% Core Enzyme State
    H --> P[Free Core Enzyme]
    O --> P
    P --> Q[Core RNAP in Cytoplasm]
    
    %% Sigma Factor Availability
    R[Sigma Factor Pool] --> S{Which Sigma<br/>Factor?}
    S -->|σ70| T[Sigma-70 Available]
    S -->|σ38| U[Sigma-38 Available]
    S -->|σ32| V[Sigma-32 Available]
    S -->|Other| W[Alternative Sigma]
    
    %% Anti-Sigma Regulation
    T --> X{Anti-Sigma<br/>Present?}
    X -->|No| Y[Free Sigma-70]
    X -->|Yes| Z[Sigma Sequestered]
    
    %% Holoenzyme Formation
    Q --> AA{Core RNAP<br/>Available?}
    Y --> AA
    
    AA --> ANDGATE1{Core Available AND<br/>Sigma Available?}
    ANDGATE1 -->|Yes| AB[Core-Sigma Association]
    ANDGATE1 -->|No| AC[Wait State]
    
    AB --> AD[RNAP Holoenzyme Formation]
    AD --> AE[Holoenzyme in Cytoplasm]
    
    %% Promoter Recognition
    AF[Promoter DNA] --> AG{Promoter<br/>Accessible?}
    AG -->|Yes| AH[Open Promoter]
    AG -->|No| AI[\Blocked Promoter/]
    
    AE --> AJ{Holoenzyme Finds<br/>Promoter?}
    AH --> AJ
    
    AJ -->|Yes| AK[Promoter Recognition]
    AK --> AL[Closed Complex Formation]
    AL --> AM[DNA Melting]
    AM --> AN[Open Complex Formation]
    
    %% Transcription Initiation
    AN --> AO{NTPs and<br/>Factors Ready?}
    AO --> ANDGATE2{Open Complex AND<br/>NTPs Available?}
    
    ANDGATE2 -->|Yes| AP[Abortive Initiation Cycles]
    AP --> AQ[Promoter Clearance]
    AQ --> AR[Sigma Release]
    AR --> AS[Elongation Complex]
    
    %% Recycling Complete
    AS --> AT[New Transcript Synthesis]
    AR --> AU[Sigma Returns to Pool]
    AU --> R
    
    %% Failed Paths
    Z --> AV[Reduced Transcription]
    AC --> AW[Delayed Reinitiation]
    AI --> AX[/No Transcription/]
    
